      "description": "A single JSON file containing a top-level 'findings' array. Each finding must include 'location', 'trigger_condition', 'affected_signal', 'confidence' (0-1), and 'rationale'. An empty or missing findings array is treated as a no-detection submission and will fail grading."
    }
